      "evidence": "deliverables/AgentNexus-M1.6.1/source/src/agentnexus/harness/index.ts:104; scheduler.ts:343",
      "finding": "Current onDeliverable only calls TaskScheduler.wake; wake may resume an idle WAITING Task to QUEUED and does not dispatch a model turn. Long-lived resident/coordinator execution needs an explicit Host event driver."
    },
    {
      "id": "WAKE-02",
      "severity": "integration-risk",
      "evidence": "deliverables/AgentNexus-M1.6.1/source/src/agentnexus/harness/messages.ts:199-215",
      "finding": "The optional onDeliverable callback may be absent; optional chaining still leads to notified=true and a NOTIFIED wake. Even an installed callback returning successfully may do no Task work. NOTIFIED is notification bookkeeping, never processed/completed evidence."
    },
